source: Spirit Control
description: >
  A Character within your Melee Range regains 2d10(bT) + your Might Life and Ki Points.
text: >
  Spiritual Healing: You have the ability to restore someone's energy and vitality.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: Spirit Control
  –TP Cost: 10
  –KP Cost: 10(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Target a Character within your Melee Range. That Character regains 2d10(bT) Life and Ki Points. Increase the Dice Score of this roll by your Might.
